# Vercel deploy target

Production for this repo must use the **openara** Vercel team (`izak@openara.com.au`), never `izakjosef-gmailcoms-projects` / `izakjosef@gmail.com`.

Before any `vercel deploy`, `vercel env`, or domain change:

1. Run `node scripts/assert-vercel-target.mjs` (or `npm run vercel:check`).
2. Confirm `.vercel/project.json` is not org `team_Tr6MBnYJHkM0PMsGobaTtZgH`.
3. Use `--scope openara` on CLI commands.

If the assert fails: `vercel logout && vercel login`, sign in as the openara owner, then `vercel link --yes --scope openara --project kinsa-saas`.

Committed source of truth: `vercel-target.json`.
